        "上半平面围道"
      ],
      "question_type": "基础留数积分",
      "method": [
        "构造上半平面闭围道",
        "求极点及留数",
        "应用留数定理"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "找出上半平面极点 $z=i$",
        "求该极点留数",
        "计算 $2\\pi i\\cdot\\mathrm{Res}$"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "rational_function_contour_integral",
        "template": "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^2+1}dx",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$f(z)=\\dfrac{1}{z^2+1}$ 的极点为 $z=\\pm i$，上半平面内仅有 $z=i$。",
            "在简单极点 $z=i$ 处，$\\mathrm{Res}_{z=i}f=\\dfrac{1}{2z}\\Big|_{z=i}=\\dfrac{1}{2i}$。",
            "闭上半围道内积分为 $2\\pi i\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2i}=\\pi$；当半径$\\to\\infty$弧上积分$\\to0$，故 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^2+1}dx=\\pi$（与已知反正切结果一致）。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2020-c0d447f766-q01-practice-01",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2020"
    },
    {
      "text": "求 $\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^4+1}dx$ 的值。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "留数定理",
        "四次多项式极点",
        "复数指数形式",
        "留数求和"
      ],
      "question_type": "有理函数反常积分",
      "method": [
        "求四个极点",
        "取上半平面两极点",
        "求留数和并应用留数定理"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "解 $x^4=-1$ 得四极点",
        "选上半平面极点 $e^{i\\pi/4},e^{3i\\pi/4}$",
        "求各留数并相加",
        "代入留数定理求积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "rational_function_contour_integral",
        "template": "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^4+1}dx",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "极点满足 $z^4=-1$，即 $z=e^{i\\pi/4},e^{3i\\pi/4},e^{5i\\pi/4},e^{7i\\pi/4}$；上半平面内为 $z_1=e^{i\\pi/4}$，$z_2=e^{3i\\pi/4}$。",
            "对 $f(z)=1/(z^4+1)$，在极点 $z_0$（$z_0^4=-1$）处 $\\mathrm{Res}=\\dfrac{1}{4z_0^3}=\\dfrac{-z_0}{4}$（因 $z_0^4=-1\\Rightarrow z_0^3=-1/z_0$）。",
            "$\\mathrm{Res}_{z_1}+\\mathrm{Res}_{z_2}=-\\dfrac{1}{4}(e^{i\\pi/4}+e^{3i\\pi/4})=-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}i-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}i\\right)=-\\dfrac{i\\sqrt2}{4}$。",
            "由留数定理，$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^4+1}dx=2\\pi i\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{i\\sqrt2}{4}\\right)=\\dfrac{\\pi\\sqrt2}{2}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2020-c0d447f766-q01-practice-02",
