      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "由原题结论 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2}{x^4+a^4}dx=\\dfrac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2\\,a}$，代入 $a=1$ 得预期值 $\\dfrac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2}$。",
