      "math_structure": {
        "type": "rational_function_contour_integral",
        "template": "\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^4+b^4}dx",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "令 $x=bt$（$b>0$），则 $dx=b\\,dt$，且 $x^4+b^4=b^4(t^4+1)$，于是 $$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^4+b^4}dx=\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{b\\,dt}{b^4(t^4+1)}=\\frac{1}{b^3}\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{dt}{t^4+1}$$",
            "代入已知结果 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{dt}{t^4+1}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2}$，得 $$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^4+b^4}dx=\\frac{1}{b^3}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2}=\\frac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2\\,b^3}$$",
            "验算：当 $b=1$ 时公式给出 $\\pi/\\sqrt2$，与练习2直接留数计算结果一致，公式正确。"
